Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.27,0:23:02.81,pm2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC49517&\fax-0.05\frz2.171\pos(506,458)}太陽系星球的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.19,0:23:06.23,pm2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDDAD40&\frz1.357\fs60\pos(682,244)}阿爾泰爾 - 天鷹座α星
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.90,0:23:07.53,pm1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(866,482)\c&H453E3C&}搜索「阿爾泰爾」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:08.57,pm1,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\pos(334,68)}阿爾泰爾
